      <p class="recommendation-strategy" data-recommendation-strategy>
        Mission Bay offers the strongest combination of modern inventory, accessibility, amenity context, and future flexibility for this profile. SoMa and the Financial District should still be pressure-tested for pricing, commute patterns, and building availability.
      </p>
      <ul class="recommendation-evaluate-list recommendation-evaluate-list--memo" data-recommendation-evaluate-next>
        <li>Modern and flexible office inventory.</li>
        <li>Strong transit and talent access.</li>
        <li>Good fit for growth-stage companies.</li>
        <li>Useful comparison set before narrowing to individual buildings.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="recommendations-section recommendation-memo-section recommendation-primary-section" aria-labelledby="primary-market-deep-dive">
