          <div class="recommendation-building-list">
            <article class="recommendation-building-card">
              <span>Mission Bay</span>
              <h5><a href="/commercial-real-estate/building/CA/san-francisco/1800-owens-st/">1800 Owens St</a></h5>
              <p>This building helps benchmark modern Mission Bay office options near UCSF and the district's technology and life science ecosystem.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="recommendation-building-card">
              <span>Mission Bay</span>
              <h5><a href="/commercial-real-estate/building/CA/san-francisco/500-terry-francois-blvd/">500 Terry Francois Blvd</a></h5>
              <p>This is a waterfront Mission Bay reference point for teams that care about newer office context and nearby transit access.</p>
